  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3110 describes requirements for network management and orchestration of IMT-2020. It describes high-level and functional requirements. The functional requirements consist of two levels: a) lifecycle management for all slices and b) instance management pertinent to each slice.</abstract>
